SUMMARY:Wine Dinner Springfield IL
DESCRIPTION:September 8 — Wine Dinner | Springfield\, IL\n\nThe Corkscrew | 5:30–9 PM \nJoin Gundlach Bundschu at The Corkscrew for a special evening of Sonoma wine\, food\, and storytelling. Taste through a selection of wines from our historic Rhinefarm estate while exploring the vineyards\, winemaking\, and six generations of Bundschu family history behind each bottle. Settle in for a great meal\, great wines\, and a little Sonoma hospitality in Springfield. \n\nBOOK NOW
