SUMMARY:Wines & More Milford\, CT
DESCRIPTION:September 13 — Wine Brunch | Milford\, CT\nWines and More | 11 AM–2 PM \nJoin Gundlach Bundschu for a special Sunday wine brunch at Wines and More in Milford. Enjoy a selection of wines from our historic Rhinefarm estate in Sonoma\, paired with a relaxed brunch experience and the stories behind six generations of family winemaking. Come hungry\, come curious\, and spend your Sunday with a little Sonoma in Connecticut. \nBOOK NOW
