SUMMARY:Wine Dinner Moline IL
DESCRIPTION:September 17 — Wine Dinner | Moline\, IL\nThe Axis Hotel | 5–9 PM \nExperience an evening of Sonoma wine and hospitality with Gundlach Bundschu at The Axis Hotel in Moline. This special wine dinner will feature a selection of Gundlach Bundschu wines thoughtfully paired throughout the evening\, along with stories from our family’s six generations of farming and winemaking at Rhinefarm. A great opportunity to explore the wines\, the vineyards\, and the history behind California’s oldest family-owned winery.
