SUMMARY:Sonoma Valley Vintage Festival
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Valley Grand Tasting (Wines from Gundlach Bundschu)\nSonoma Barracks\nSaturday\, September 26th: 6pm\nThe Sonoma Valley Grand Tasting is an elegant evening of wine tasting under the stars at the historic Sonoma Barracks. Guests will explore the diverse wines and growing regions of Sonoma Valley\, sampling an exceptional selection from over 40 wineries. This walk-around tasting event offers the chance to meet winemakers and winegrowers\, enjoy current vintages from all six Sonoma Valley appellations\, and savor locally prepared cuisine from top chefs and artisans. \nMore event news to come through 2026…
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/vintage-festival-2026/
CATEGORIES:GB on the Road,National
