SUMMARY:Common Pantry Fall Fundraiser Chicago\, IL
DESCRIPTION:October 2 — Common Pantry Fall Fundraiser | Chicago\, IL\nLincoln Square | 5–9 PM \nJoin Gundlach Bundschu for an evening of wine and community in support of Common Pantry’s Fall Fundraiser in Chicago’s Lincoln Square. Fifteen years. One night. Food\, drinks\, music and a whole lot of fun – all benefiting Common Pantry. Join us at Artifact Events on Friday\, October 2\, from 7–11pm as we go bigger than ever before\, taking over both the North and South buildings for a night that’s equal parts delicious\, joyful and meaningful. Sponsorships\, party tickets\, and other ways to join the fun available \nBOOK NOW
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/wine-dinner-moline-il-2/
